- ### Calculations
+ ### Cálculos

- A formula written in quantities is checked as it is written. Each step must combine its
- units coherently, and the units of the result are computed from the units of the inputs, so
- the dimensions of a calculation are verified before it ever runs. The
- [displacement of a body under constant acceleration](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equations_of_motion#Constant_translational_acceleration_in_a_straight_line),
- `s = ut + ½at²`, reads directly:
+ Una fórmula escrita con magnitudes se comprueba tal como se escribe. Cada paso debe combinar
+ sus unidades de forma coherente, y las unidades del resultado se calculan a partir de las
+ unidades de las entradas, de modo que las dimensiones de un cálculo se verifican antes de que
+ llegue a ejecutarse. El
+ [desplazamiento de un cuerpo con aceleración constante](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equations_of_motion#Constant_translational_acceleration_in_a_straight_line),
+ `s = ut + ½at²`, se lee directamente:

= `s = ut + ½at²`, reads directly:
=
